          "text": "Description: On July 9, 2012, between 9:30 PM and 9:50 PM, a witness is intrigued by the observation of an object in the sky. An object described as both rounded and triangular moves silently before disappearing into a cloud. The vertical movement of the object (local wind is light: see weather), its reflection, and its shape (see example of helium-filled party balloon in the annex) strongly suggest a festive balloon. The GEIPAN classifies this case as \"B\": probable observation of a party balloon.",
